<view class="page">
  <view class="title">节律训练与家长陪同</view>
  <view class="subtitle">
    容忍窗 {{tolMs}}ms ｜固定节拍 ｜连续变速 ｜家长陪同
  </view>

  <view class="topBpmCard" wx:if="{{mode==='stage1'}}">
    <view class="topBpmHeader">
      <view class="topBpmTitle">固定节拍节奏选择</view>
      <view class="topBpmBadge {{stage1BpmUnlocked ? 'unlocked' : 'locked'}}">{{stage1BpmUnlocked ? '已解锁' : '未解锁'}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="topBpmValue">{{bpm}} BPM</view>
    <slider
      min="{{stage1BpmMin}}"
      max="{{stage1BpmMax}}"
      step="1"
      value="{{bpm}}"
      bindchange="onBpmChange"
      disabled="{{isRunning || !stage1BpmUnlocked}}"
    />
    <view class="tip" wx:if="{{stage1BpmUnlocked}}">已解锁后可为固定节拍选择速度；开始训练后会锁定当前值，整轮保持固定节奏。</view>
    <view class="tip" wx:else>先按默认节奏完成一次固定节拍训练；解锁后，这里会开放固定 BPM 选择。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="modeRow">
    <button class="modeBtn {{mode==='stage1'?'active':''}}" bindtap="setMode" data-mode="stage1" disabled="{{isRunning}}">固定节拍</button>
    <button class="modeBtn {{mode==='stage2'?'active':''}}" bindtap="setMode" data-mode="stage2" disabled="{{isRunning}}">连续变速</button>
    <button class="modeBtn {{mode==='stage3'?'active':''}}" bindtap="setMode" data-mode="stage3" disabled="{{isRunning}}">家长陪同</button>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view wx:if="{{mode==='stage1'}}">
      <view class="row">
        <view class="label">当前固定 BPM：{{bpm}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="tip" wx:if="{{stage1BpmUnlocked}}">顶部滑条只作用于固定节拍，当前这一轮会按 {{bpm}} BPM 固定运行。</view>
      <view class="tip" wx:else>当前固定节拍仍按默认速度运行；通过后会解锁顶部的固定 BPM 选择。</view>
      <view class="tip">60 秒一轮，命中率 ≥ 70% 解锁连续变速与家长陪同。</view>

      <view class="metronome">
        <view class="metronomeStage">
          <drum-character hitSeq="{{drumHitSeq}}"></drum-character>
        </view>
        <view class="hint">{{isRunning ? '跟着节拍点下面按钮' : '设置好后开始'}}</view>
      </view>

      <view class="btnRow">
        <button class="btn" type="primary" bindtap="onStart" disabled="{{isRunning}}">开始 {{durationSec}} 秒</button>
        <button class="btn" bindtap="onStop" disabled="{{!isRunning}}">停止</button>
      </view>

      <view class="tapArea">
        <button class="tapBtn" bindtap="onTapBeat" disabled="{{!isRunning}}">点我打拍</button>
      </view>

      <view class="stats">
        <view class="stat">剩余：{{remainingSec}}s</view>
        <view class="stat">拍数：{{beatCount}}</view>
        <view class="stat">命中：{{hitCount}}</view>
        <view class="stat">命中率：{{accuracyPct}}%</view>
        <view class="stat">最近误差：{{lastErrMs}}ms</view>
      </view>

      <view class="result" wx:if="{{!isRunning && hasResult}}">
        <view class="resultLine">本轮结果：命中率 {{accuracyPct}}%</view>
        <view class="resultLine" wx:if="{{passed}}">✅ 固定节拍达标：已解锁连续变速与家长陪同</view>
        <view class="resultLine" wx:if="{{!passed}}">❗未达标（需要 ≥ 70%）</view>
        <view class="btnRow">
          <button class="btn" bindtap="onExport" disabled="{{logCount===0}}">导出数据（复制）</button>
          <button class="btn" bindtap="onReset">清空结果</button>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{mode==='stage2'}}">
      <view class="row stage2TopRow">
        <view class="label">固定基准：{{bpmBase}}｜当前速度：{{bpmCur}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="row stage2TopRow">
        <view class="label">幅度：{{range}}｜步长：{{delta}}｜目标速度：{{bpmTarget}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="tip">连续变速为单段连续 60 秒训练：中间无回合切换、无准备 2 秒、无节拍重启。每 10 个系统拍构成 1 个 block，动态难度只改幅度，不直接改当前速度。</view>
      <view class="prepBadge">{{stage2PhaseText}}</view>

      <view class="metronome">
        <view class="metronomeStage">
          <drum-character hitSeq="{{drumHitSeq}}"></drum-character>
        </view>
        <view class="hint">{{isRunning ? '跟着节拍点下面按钮' : '设置好后开始'}}</view>
      </view>

      <view class="btnRow">
        <button class="btn" type="primary" bindtap="onStart" disabled="{{isRunning}}">开始 {{durationSec}} 秒</button>
        <button class="btn" bindtap="onStop" disabled="{{!isRunning}}">停止</button>
      </view>

      <view class="tapArea">
        <button class="tapBtn" bindtap="onTapBeat" disabled="{{!isRunning}}">点我打拍</button>
      </view>

      <view class="stats">
        <view class="stat">剩余：{{remainingSec}}s</view>
        <view class="stat">拍数：{{beatCount}}</view>
        <view class="stat">命中：{{hitCount}}</view>
        <view class="stat">命中率：{{accuracyPct}}%</view>
        <view class="stat">最近误差：{{lastErrMs}}ms</view>
      </view>

      <view class="stats">
        <view class="stat">Block：{{blockIndex}}</view>
        <view class="stat">acc10：{{acc10Pct}}%</view>
        <view class="stat">mean_err：{{meanErr10}}ms</view>
        <view class="stat">状态：{{stage2PhaseText}}</view>
      </view>

      <view class="result" wx:if="{{!isRunning && hasResult}}">
        <view class="resultLine">本轮结果：命中率 {{accuracyPct}}%</view>
        <view class="resultLine">✅ 连续变速训练已完成</view>
        <view class="btnRow">
          <button class="btn" bindtap="onExport" disabled="{{logCount===0}}">导出数据（复制）</button>
          <button class="btn" bindtap="onReset">清空结果</button>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{mode==='stage3'}}" class="stage3Wrap">
      <view class="stage3HeaderCard">
        <view class="stage3HeaderTop">
          <view class="stage3HeaderTitle">家长陪同训练</view>
          <view class="topBpmBadge {{stage3Unlocked ? 'unlocked' : 'locked'}}">{{stage3Unlocked ? '已解锁' : '未解锁'}}</view>
        </view>
        <view class="tip">左半屏为家长区，右半屏为孩子区。谁亮谁点；轮到对方时，本侧会灰化以帮助抑制冲动点击。</view>
      </view>

      <view class="stage3Menu" wx:if="{{!isRunning}}">
        <view class="stage3MenuTitle">请选择阶段</view>

        <view class="stage3PhaseCard {{stage3SelectedPhase===1?'selected':''}} {{!stage3Unlocked?'locked':''}}" bindtap="onSelectStage3Phase" data-phase="1">
          <view class="stage3PhaseMain">
            <view>
              <view class="stage3PhaseTitle">第一阶段</view>
              <view class="stage3PhaseDesc">60 秒｜每拍换人：家长、孩子、家长、孩子……</view>
            </view>
            <view class="stage3PhaseBadge {{stage3Phase1Passed ? 'passed' : (stage3Unlocked ? 'ready' : 'locked')}}">{{stage3Phase1Passed ? '已通过' : (stage3Unlocked ? '可进入' : '未解锁')}}</view>
          </view>
        </view>

        <view class="stage3PhaseCard {{stage3SelectedPhase===2?'selected':''}} {{!stage3Phase1Passed?'locked':''}}" bindtap="onSelectStage3Phase" data-phase="2">
          <view class="stage3PhaseMain">
            <view>
              <view class="stage3PhaseTitle">第二阶段</view>
              <view class="stage3PhaseDesc">60 秒｜每两拍换人：家长、家长、孩子、孩子……</view>
            </view>
            <view class="stage3PhaseBadge {{stage3Phase2Passed ? 'passed' : (stage3Phase1Passed ? 'ready' : 'locked')}}">{{stage3Phase2Passed ? '已通过' : (stage3Phase1Passed ? '可进入' : '锁定')}}</view>
          </view>
          <view class="stage3PhaseLock" wx:if="{{!stage3Phase1Passed}}">先通过第一阶段后解锁</view>
        </view>

        <view class="stage3PhaseCard {{stage3SelectedPhase===3?'selected':''}} {{!stage3Phase2Passed?'locked':''}}" bindtap="onSelectStage3Phase" data-phase="3">
          <view class="stage3PhaseMain">
            <view>
              <view class="stage3PhaseTitle">第三阶段</view>
              <view class="stage3PhaseDesc">60 秒｜每 8 拍第 8 拍显示“停”，双方都不点击</view>
            </view>
            <view class="stage3PhaseBadge {{stage3Phase3Completed ? 'passed' : (stage3Phase2Passed ? 'ready' : 'locked')}}">{{stage3Phase3Completed ? '已完成' : (stage3Phase2Passed ? '可进入' : '锁定')}}</view>
          </view>
          <view class="stage3PhaseLock" wx:if="{{!stage3Phase2Passed}}">先通过第二阶段后解锁</view>
        </view>

        <view class="stage3IntroCard">
          <view class="stage3IntroTitle">当前选择：{{stage3CurrentPhaseName}}</view>
          <view class="stage3IntroRule">{{stage3RuleText}}</view>
          <view class="stage3IntroRule">固定速度：{{stage3FixedBpm}} BPM ｜通过标准：仅看孩子命中率，需 ≥ 70%</view>
          <view class="btnRow">
            <button class="btn" type="primary" bindtap="onStart" disabled="{{!stage3Unlocked || (stage3SelectedPhase===2 && !stage3Phase1Passed) || (stage3SelectedPhase===3 && !stage3Phase2Passed)}}">开始 {{stage3CurrentPhaseName}}</button>
            <button class="btn" bindtap="onReset">清空结果</button>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="stage3Train" wx:if="{{isRunning}}">
        <view class="stage3RunHeader">
          <view class="stage3RunTitle">{{stage3CurrentPhaseName}}进行中</view>
          <view class="stage3RunSub">{{stage3StatusText}}</view>
        </view>

        <view class="stage3Board">
          <view class="stage3CenterStop" wx:if="{{stage3StopBeat}}">🛑 停</view>

          <view class="stage3Side parent {{stage3ActiveSide==='parent'?'active':''}} {{stage3ParentDim?'dim':''}}" bindtouchstart="onStage3SideTouchStart" bindtap="onStage3SideTap" data-side="parent">
            <view class="stage3SideLabel">家长区</view>
            <view class="stage3SideHint">{{stage3ActiveSide==='parent' && !stage3StopBeat ? '请点击' : (stage3StopBeat ? '这一拍不点' : '等待中')}} </view>
          </view>

          <view class="stage3Side child {{stage3ActiveSide==='child'?'active':''}} {{stage3ChildDim?'dim':''}} {{stage3ChildTapFlash?'tapFlash':''}} {{stage3ChildTapFeedbackType==='hit'?'feedback-hit':(stage3ChildTapFeedbackType==='miss'?'feedback-miss':'feedback-ack')}}" bindtouchstart="onStage3SideTouchStart" bindtap="onStage3SideTap" data-side="child">
            <view class="stage3SideLabel">孩子区</view>
            <view class="stage3SideHint">{{stage3ActiveSide==='child' && !stage3StopBeat ? '请点击' : (stage3StopBeat ? '这一拍不点' : '等待中')}} </view>
            <view class="stage3TapAck {{stage3ChildTapFeedbackVisible?'show':''}} {{stage3ChildTapFeedbackType}}" wx:if="{{stage3ChildTapFeedbackVisible}}">{{stage3ChildTapFeedbackText}}</view>
            <view class="stage3TapPulse" wx:if="{{stage3ChildTapFlash}}"></view>
          </view>
        </view>

        <view class="stats">
          <view class="stat">剩余：{{remainingSec}}s</view>
          <view class="stat">已评估拍数：{{stage3ScoredBeatCount}}</view>
          <view class="stat">孩子命中：{{stage3ChildCorrectCount}}</view>
          <view class="stat">孩子命中率：{{stage3ChildAccPct}}%</view>
          <view class="stat">当前拍号：{{beatCount}}</view>
        </view>

        <view class="btnRow">
          <button class="btn" bindtap="onStop">停止本阶段</button>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="result" wx:if="{{mode==='stage3' && !isRunning && hasResult}}">
        <view class="resultLine">{{stage3CurrentPhaseName}}结果：孩子命中率 {{stage3ChildAccPct}}%</view>
        <view class="resultLine" wx:if="{{passed && stage3CurrentPhase===1}}">✅ 第一阶段已通过，已解锁第二阶段</view>
        <view class="resultLine" wx:if="{{passed && stage3CurrentPhase===2}}">✅ 第二阶段已通过，已解锁第三阶段</view>
        <view class="resultLine" wx:if="{{passed && stage3CurrentPhase===3}}">✅ 第三阶段完成并达标</view>
        <view class="resultLine" wx:if="{{!passed}}">❗未达标（需要 ≥ 70%）</view>
        <view class="btnRow">
          <button class="btn" bindtap="onExport" disabled="{{logCount===0}}">导出数据（复制）</button>
          <button class="btn" bindtap="onReset">清空结果</button>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="footer">
    <view>连续变速导出以系统拍为中心；家长陪同导出包含每拍应答侧、孩子是否该点、孩子是否在窗口内命中、以及孩子整拍抑制是否成功。</view>
  </view>
</view>
